<title>UK: Argentina sees 5.0 pct GDP growth in 1997.</title>
<headline>Argentina sees 5.0 pct GDP growth in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's economic growth is likely to be five percent in 1997, undersecretary of finance Miguel Kiguel said at a conference on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The economy is turning around and growth is expected to reach five percent in 1997,&quot; Kiguel said.</p>
<p>In 1996 gross domestic product (GDP) rose by 4.4 percent, after shrinking 4.6 percent the previous year.</p>
<p>-- Hayley Pienaar, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
